#!args --config build/tests/pn_menu_small --open apps/PaintCraft/tests/fixtures/p1_plugin.png
# menu_small.uis -- menus on a small screen (a phone), lib/ui/popup.rs menu_flyout: a menu taller than
# the window scrolls, and its submenu is drawn all the same (it is built after the menu, outside
# the menu's scroll view); a submenu that has to overlap its menu lies on top of the later rows.
size 900 360
theme light
wait 16
click menu:"Effekte"
wait 16
move menuitem:"Foto"
wait 300
expect menuitem:"Porträt retuschieren…" exists
move menuitem:"Porträt retuschieren…"
wait 300
expect menuitem:"Porträt retuschieren…" hover
# the row is drawn, hovered (the flyout itself is F9F9F9)
expect pixel 295 117 #F0F0F0
key esc
key esc
wait 16
# ---- narrow: the submenu lies over its menu, its second row over the menu's next row
size 420 800
wait 16
click menu:"Datei"
wait 16
move menuitem:"Zuletzt geöffnet"
wait 300
expect menuitem:"Liste leeren" enabled
click menuitem:"Liste leeren"
wait 16
click menu:"Datei"
wait 16
move menuitem:"Zuletzt geöffnet"
wait 300
expect menuitem:"Liste leeren" disabled
